# Do NOT add `/* / 200` here.
# Cloudflare Pages always applies _redirects, even when a static file exists —
# that catch-all was rewriting every prerendered page to the homepage and
# AdSense crawled one shell for all URLs.
#
# Unmatched tool routes (/try, /map, /live, /quiz, …) still SPA-fallback to /
# because there is no top-level 404.html (Pages default SPA behaviour).
# Prerendered catalog paths (dist/<path>/index.html) are served as-is.
/api/*        /api/:splat     200
